OL,3,A'Glam, funny, kind': World remembers
OL,4,ADolly Parton as star dies from cancer
OL,5,Aaged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FFans have been leaving flowers,
OL,8,Fballoons and cards, remembering a music
OL,9,Ficon who wrote over 3,000 songs and
OL,10,Fsold more than 100 million records -
OL,11,Fher career in numbers
OL,13,FAlongside the music, Parton also
OL,14,Fdevoted decades of her life to
OL,15,Fcharitable causes, particularly child
OL,16,Fliteracy with millions gaining access
OL,17,Fto free books across five countries
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
