OL,3,ATaylor Swift and Beyonce lead tributes
OL,4,Aafter death of 'bold and brilliant'
OL,5,ADolly Parton
OL,6,
OL,7,FParton is known for iconic songs
OL,8,Fincluding Jolene, 9 to 5 and I Will
OL,9,FAlways Love You. She was also an
OL,10,Factress and philanthropist, who helped
OL,11,Ffund one of the first Covid-19 vaccines
OL,12,Fand poured millions into improving
OL,13,Fchildren's literacy.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
